INt. underground zombie laboratory - night

DOLORES, the cleaning lady,  pushes a mop through sinister underground hallways. She is wearing a standard cleaning outfit. On the cart a bluetooth speaker is blasting Mexican Country music loudly. DOLORES line steps and sings in Spanish as she moves along. Several research in full Quarantine PPE, they pause to watch her pass, shaking their heads.

She mops and dances past windows that reveal ZOMBIES in various stages of agitation.